OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-hit families keep 'brave
OL,4,Aface' without power
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "It's not ideal, but storms
OL,7,Fcan't be helped, we do appreciate that.
OL,8,FWe're trying to keep a brave face." SP
OL,9,FElectricity North West (ENW) told her
OL,10,Fpower was expected to be back by
OL,11,FTuesday evening in the "worst-case
OL,12,Fscenario".
